			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@AmeliaBR\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>AmeliaBR</span></a></span> my partner bought a belt sander and we got it figured out! it was a few KG of filament, yes! I’ll post some better pictures after the other side cures properly.</p><p>The eyes aren’t transparent but are socket holes. I could throw some little battery lights in there for a quick photo but definitely not a long term option 🤔</p>",
